 "description": "Version 1.1 of the non-authoritative navigation layer for the Semantic Economy governance architecture. The Map is authoritative for routing only: it does not bind, enact, ratify, or amend, and it yields to the Constitution and to ratified protocols whenever a conflict appears.\n\nIt indexes the constitutional spine, Liberatory and Soteriological operator systems, constitutional Operators, rights and reception layers, adjudication and diagnostic instruments, mantle and heteronym architecture, contributors, interfaces, Ledger invariants, article-to-instrument relations, and identified governance gaps. Its status assignments and corpus counts are a dated architectural snapshot.",
